msgstr "Tidak ada webcam yang ditemukan di sistem"

#: src/onboarding.py:386
msgid ""
"Please configure your camera yourself if you are sure a compatible cam"
"era is connected"
msgstr ""
"Silakan konfigurasikan sendiri kamera Anda jika Anda yakin kamera yang"
" kompatibel telah terhubung"

