msgstr "Kamera yang dipilih tidak dapat dibuka"

#: src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Try to select another one"
msgstr "Cobalah untuk memilih yang lain"

#: src/onboarding.py:639
msgid ""
"Please visit\n<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-em"
"itter\">https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\nto en"
"able your ir emitter"
msgstr ""
"Silakan kunjungi\n<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-i"
"r-emitter\">https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\nu"
"ntuk mengaktifkan pemancar IR Anda"

#: src/onboarding.py:704
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Penyiapan pencahayaan 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Penyiapan pencahayaan 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:723
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Tidak dapat menyimpan model wajah"

#: src/onboarding.py:728 src/onboarding.py:775
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Pindai model kedua"

#: src/onboarding.py:734
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Tidak dapat merekam model kedua"

#: src/onboarding.py:735
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must "
"still be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than"
" turning it off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from S"
"ettings."
msgstr ""
"Model pertama Anda disimpan, jadi login wajah sudah berfungsi. Ruangan"
" harus tetap cukup terang untuk melihat wajah Anda — ubah lampunya dar"
"ipada mematikannya — lalu coba lagi, atau lewati dan tambahkan model n"
"anti dari Pengaturan."

#: src/onboarding.py:769
msgid "Second scan: different lighting"
msgstr "Pemindaian kedua: pencahayaan berbeda"

#: src/onboarding.py:771
msgid ""
"First model saved. Now change the light — for example turn a lamp on o"
"r off, move away from the window, or use the other room light — keep y"
"our face clearly visible, then press Scan again."
msgstr ""
"Model pertama disimpan. Sekarang ubah lampu — misalnya menyalakan atau"
" mematikan lampu, menjauh dari jendela, atau menggunakan lampu ruangan"
" lain — jaga agar wajah Anda tetap terlihat jelas, lalu tekan Pindai l"
"agi."

#: src/onboarding.py:805
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Penyiapan Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.py:818
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dapat secara otomatis membuka kunci {} Anda menggunakan o"
"tentikasi wajah (dompet terdeteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Memerik"
"sa perangkat keras dan alat TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:838
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dapat secara otomatis membuka kunci {} Anda menggunakan o"
"tentikasi wajah (dompet terdeteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Perangk"
"at keras TPM terdeteksi. Menginstal <i>tpm2-tools</i> secara otomatis."
".."

#: src/onboarding.py:850
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dapat secara otomatis membuka kunci {} Anda menggunakan o"
"tentikasi wajah (dompet terdeteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> TPM 2.0"
" perangkat keras aktif. Kata sandi Anda akan tersegel dengan aman di d"
"alam TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:852
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dapat secara otomatis membuka kunci {} Anda menggunakan o"
"tentikasi wajah (dompet terdeteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Perangk"
"at keras TPM terdeteksi, tetapi pemasangan otomatis <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"gagal. Jalankan <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Kembali ke c"
"ache kredensial berbasis perangkat lunak."

#: src/onboarding.py:854
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dapat secara otomatis membuka kunci {} Anda menggunakan o"
"tentikasi wajah (dompet terdeteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Tidak a"
"da perangkat keras TPM yang terdeteksi. Menggunakan cache kredensial b"
"erbasis perangkat lunak (AES-256-GCM)."

