#: src/main.glade:122
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks "
"to the camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps ("
"or in daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to kee"
"p unlocking reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Hanya satu model wajah yang terdaftar. Pencahayaan mengubah tampilan w"
"ajah Anda di mata kamera, sehingga satu model bisa gagal di malam hari"
" di bawah lampu (atau di siang hari). Tambahkan model kedua yang direk"
"am dalam cahaya berbeda agar pembukaan kunci tetap dapat diandalkan ka"
"pan saja sepanjang hari."

